{"id":"n72158-1-12","stage":1,"title":"친척 · 亲戚","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72158-1-12-1","ko":"명절 때마다 네가 친척 동생들을 다 돌본다고?","zh":"每次过节都是你在照顾所有的亲戚弟弟妹妹吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"명절","meaning":"节日","explanation":"명절：节日","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"친척","meaning":"亲戚","explanation":"친척：亲戚","readings":[{"term":"친척","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72158","senseId":"1","lemma":"친척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친척","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3"}},{"text":"동생들을","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생들을","audio":"/audio/9731bd76e8fc778313f4.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"ter