dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"사촌들","meaning":"堂表亲，堂表兄弟姐妹","explanation":"사촌：堂表亲，堂表兄弟姐妹；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사촌","audio":"/audio/cd2309748606381c21a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61316","senseId":"1","lemma":"사촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사촌들","audio":"/audio/44673fb9f96a4d6e7f8f.mp3"}},{"text":"중에는","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에는","audio":"/audio/e9bbf8696632882a7a7a.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"맏이거든.","meaning":"老大","explanation":"맏이：老大；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맏이","audio":"/audio/b8690a8e95c54be7c309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53063","senseId":"1","lemma":"맏이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맏이거든","audio":"/audio/fda68f542daa0048b13b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"cd2309748606381c","term":"사촌","zh":"堂表亲，堂表兄弟姐妹","audio":"/audio/cd2309748606381c21a5.mp3","entryId":"61316","definition":"与父母亲兄弟姐妹的儿女的亲戚关系；或指那种关系的人。","pronunciation":["사ː촌"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term"